                  <msItem>
                     <title>Duns Scotus, etc.</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">MSS. 227 &amp; 228 were written in the Oxford
                        convent, but it is probable that MS. 227 at least was at York convent (q.
                        v.) at the Dissolution.</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">For W. Vavaseur, Warden at Oxford c. 1500 and
                        warden of York at the dissolution see Little, Grey Friars in Oxford, p.
                        130.</note>
                  </msItem>
               </msContents>
